CC0 1.0 Universal — Public Domain Dedication

The job listings in this repository (data/listings.json and README.md) are
factual records — company, role title, location, a public application link, and
a posting date. To the extent possible under law, ApplyLoop has waived all
copyright and related rights to this data.

No attribution is required. A link back to https://applyloop.pro is appreciated
but never expected.

Job descriptions are NOT reproduced here and are not covered by this dedication;
they remain the property of the employers who wrote them. This repository links
to them and does not copy them.

